      "text": {
        "format": 1,
        "content": "<h1>Take the Scent</h1><p><em>The hound lifts its nose and finds the freshest thread of scent.</em></p><h2>Rules</h2><p><strong>ID:</strong> monster-trail-hound-take-the-scent</p><p><strong>Action:</strong> Maneuver</p><p>Gain 1 Boon on its next Reason scent-tracking roll before turn end; needs a scent trail. No automatic discovery.</p><p><strong>Limits:</strong> Costs its Maneuver; no extra action is granted.</p>"
      },
